.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Ascon-Hash256 cryptographic hash function\&. 

A cryptographic hash function maps an arbitrary-length message to a fixed-length digest in a deterministic and collision-resistant manner\&. ASCON-Hash256 realises this construction through a sponge operating over a 320-bit permutation state, absorbing the padded message in 64-bit rate blocks and squeezing a 256-bit digest, as standardised in NIST SP 800-232\&.

.PP
